# 副簽
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:簽署文件嘅第二份副本（量詞：份）
eng:duplicate copy of a signed document
<eg>
yue:呢份合約要簽兩份，一份留喺公司，一份副簽俾你。 (ni1 fan1 ngok4 yuet4 jiu3 saap3 loueng5, yat1 fan1 lau4 wun4 keoi1 geung1, yat1 fan1 ngo2 caap3 bei2 nei5.)
eng:This contract needs to be signed in two copies; one stays with the company, and the duplicate copy is for you. [end of text]


